<title>HONG KONG: Thai Farmers Bank sets US$150 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Thai Farmers Bank sets US$150 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger DKB Asia on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THAI FARMERS BANK PCL, ACTING THROUGH ITS HK BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$150 MLN   COUPON     6ML+35BP MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	   ISS PRICE  PAR	LAUNCHED  23.JUN.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	   CALLS	NONE     REPLIES   11.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    --	     REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    $500K</p>
<p> RATING     --	     SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	    CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  THAILAND     GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> PAY DATE   25.JUL.97 (TENTATIVE)</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p> CO-ARRANGERS     US$8-10 MLN   35.0BP   ALL-IN  42.0</p>
<p> CO-LEAD MGRS     US$6-7 MLN    32.5BP   ALL-IN  41.5</p>
<p> SENIOR MGRS	US$4-5 MLN    27.5BP   ALL-IN  40.5</p>
<p> MANAGERS	   US$2-3 MLN    25.0BP   ALL-IN  40.0</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   DKB ASIA, ASAHI FINANCE (HK), DEVELOPMENT BANK OF</p>
<p>		 SINGAPORE, DRESDNER (SOUTH EAST ASIA) AND</p>
<p>		 TOKYO-MITSUBISHI INTERNATIONAL (HK).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
